7512:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TI1 as Input.
7513:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIMx to select the TIM peripheral.
